{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46826","headline":"江寺春残寄幕中知己二首 一 · 齐己","name":"江寺春残寄幕中知己二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁遣西来负岳云，自由归去竟何因。\n山龛薜荔应残雪，江寺玫瑰又度春。\n早岁便师无学士，临年却作有爲人。\n何妨夜醮时相忆，伴醉佯狂笑老身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}